{:strongs 5116, :hebrew "נוה", :lang :zh-Hans, :gloss "(adjectively) at home; hence (by implication of satisfaction) lovely; also (noun) a home, of God (temple), men (residence), flocks (pasture), or wild animals (den)", :text "(形容词用法)在家中的；由此（暗示满足）可爱的；亦作（名词）居所，指以罗欣的（殿）、人的（住所）、畜群的（牧场）或野兽的（穴）", :model "glm-5.2", :timestamp "2026-07-27T02:08:28.491132299Z"}